X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
DESCRIPTION:World Pasta Day is celebrated on October 25th to honor one of
  the world's favorite and most versatile foods. The world first celebrate
 d the day during the inaugural World Pasta Congress in Rome, Italy, on Oc
 tober 25, 1995. The International Pasta Organisation has organized World 
 Pasta Day every year since 1998, hosting conferences in various cities th
 roughout the world. https://nationaltoday.com/world-pasta-day/
LOCATION:Pastafarian Holy Day
URL:https://www.pastafariancalendar.com/world-pasta-day-2024-10-25?utm_so
 urce=ical&utm_medium=ical
