UID:pastafarian-2024-10-29
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
DESCRIPTION:National Nut Day is observed annually on October 22nd, celebr
 ating a healthy and nutritious snack. Created by Liberation Foods in 2016
  to advocate Fairtrade nuts and promote healthy living. Nuts are excellen
