 g both the spirit of the wolf and kindness to animals, especially dogs. T
 he day was created in 2018 by a 7-year-old boy from New Zealand. Traditio
 ns include eating roast meat and cake decorated like the full moon. https
 ://nationaltoday.com/wolfenoot/
