  In the sketch, two customers are lowered by wires into a greasy spoon ca
 fé and try to order a breakfast from a menu that includes Spam in almost
  every dish, much to the consternation of one of the customers. As the wa
 itress recites the Spam-filled menu, a group of Viking patrons drown out 
 all conversations with a song, repeating “Spam, Spam, Spam, Spam… Lov
 ely Spam! Wonderful Spam!” https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spam_(Monty_Py
 thon_sketch)
