TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
DESCRIPTION:The Rum Rebellion occurred on January 26, 1808, when Governor
  William Bligh was deposed by the New South Wales Corps - the first and o
 nly time in Australian history that military force has been used to overt
 hrow a government. This date is now celebrated as Australia Day. https://
 en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rum_Rebellion
LOCATION:Pastafarian Holy Day
URL:https://www.pastafariancalendar.com/rum-rebellion-day-2025-01-26?utm_
 source=ical&utm_medium=ical
