 portant they are to our ecosystems, and the threats they face. World Peng
 uin Day takes place during the annual northern migration of Adelie pengui
 ns, a species native to Antarctica. Researchers at McMurdo Station notice
 d that Adelie penguins kept passing by every year around the same day, Ap
 ril 25th. https://nationaltoday.com/world-penguin-day/
