UID:pastafarian-2025-06-27
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
DESCRIPTION:The Blue-footed Booby has captivated the human imagination fo
 r centuries with its mating display, in which its vivid baby-blue feet pl
 ay a key role. The other part of the name—booby—is reportedly taken f
 rom the Spanish for “stupid,” (“bobo”) and refers to these birds
 ’ tameness around people. Like its North Atlantic relative the Northern
  Gannet, Blue-footed Boobies catch fish in spectacular dives from high in
  the air. Watching large flocks pursue shoaling fish can be breathtaking,
  with hundreds plunging into the ocean at any moment. https://www.allabou
 tbirds.org/guide/Blue-footed_Booby/overview
LOCATION:Pastafarian Holy Day
URL:https://www.pastafariancalendar.com/blue-footed-booby-day-2025-06-27?
 utm_source=ical&utm_medium=ical
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:The Blue-footed Booby has captivated the human imagination fo
 r centuries with its mating display, in which its vivid baby-blue feet pl
 ay a key role. The other part of the name—booby—is reportedly taken f
 rom the Spanish for “stupid,” (“bobo”) and refers to these birds
 ’ tameness around people. Like its North Atlantic relative the Northern
  Gannet, Blue-footed Boobies catch fish in spectacular dives from high in
  the air. Watching large flocks pursue shoaling fish can be breathtaking,
  with hundreds plunging into the ocean at any moment. https://www.allabou
 tbirds.org/guide/Blue-footed_Booby/overview
TRIGGER:P0DT9H0M0S
END:VALARM
