UID:pastafarian-2025-11-19
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
DESCRIPTION:World Toilet Day is an official United Nations international 
 observance day on November 19 to inspire action to tackle the global sani
 tation crisis. On November 19, 2001, the NGO World Toilet Organization wa
 s founded by Jack Sim, a philanthropist from Singapore, who declared Nove
 mber 19 as World Toilet Day. In 2013, the UN officially recognized Novemb
 er 19 as World Toilet Day in a bid to make sanitation for all a global de
 velopment priority. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Toilet_Day
LOCATION:Pastafarian Holy Day
URL:https://www.pastafariancalendar.com/world-toilet-day-2025-11-19?utm_s
 ource=ical&utm_medium=ical
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:World Toilet Day is an official United Nations international 
 observance day on November 19 to inspire action to tackle the global sani
 tation crisis. On November 19, 2001, the NGO World Toilet Organization wa
 s founded by Jack Sim, a philanthropist from Singapore, who declared Nove
 mber 19 as World Toilet Day. In 2013, the UN officially recognized Novemb
 er 19 as World Toilet Day in a bid to make sanitation for all a global de
 velopment priority. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Toilet_Day
TRIGGER:P0DT9H0M0S
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
