UID:pastafarian-2025-12-17
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
DESCRIPTION:International Sloth Day is celebrated on October 20th, create
 d by the AIUNAU Foundation in 2010. The day raises awareness about the wo
