X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
DESCRIPTION:Groundhog Day is a popular North American tradition observed 
 in the United States and Canada on February 2. It derives from the Pennsy
 lvania Dutch superstition that if a groundhog emerges from its burrow on 
 this day and sees its shadow due to clear weather, it will retreat to its
  den, and winter will go on for six more weeks; if it does not see its sh
 adow because of cloudiness, spring will arrive early. https://en.wikipedi
 a.org/wiki/Groundhog_Day
LOCATION:Pastafarian Holy Day
URL:https://www.pastafariancalendar.com/groundhog-day-2026-02-02?utm_sour
 ce=ical&utm_medium=ical
