DESCRIPTION:Earth Day is an annual event celebrated worldwide on April 22
  to demonstrate support for environmental protection. On April 22, 1970, 
 U.S. Senator Gaylord Nelson founded Earth Day. Though it began in the Uni
 ted States, it became an international movement in 1990. Each year, more 
 than a billion people celebrate Earth Day to protect the planet from thin
 gs like pollution and deforestation. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earth_
 Day
