DESCRIPTION:National Blueberry Pie Day on April 28th each year ushers in 
 blueberry pie-making season. Blueberry harvest begins in April and lasts 
 until September, giving a long season full of blueberry enjoyment. In 187
 2, the first documented recipe for blueberry pie appeared in the Appledor
 e Cook Book. Blueberries are abundant in Maine, so blueberry pie is the s
 tate's official dessert. https://nationaltoday.com/national-blueberry-pie
 -day/
