 cond Saturday in July. The American Association for Nude Recreation offic
 ially designated this day in 2018 as the culminating event of National Nu
 de Recreation Week. The observance promotes body positivity and self-acce
 ptance. https://nationaltoday.com/international-skinny-dip-day/
